        "content": "// Common cathode display: A..G connect to D2..D8 through 220 ohm resistors.\n// HIGH lights a segment. The decimal point is not connected.\nconst int segmentPins[7] = {2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8}; // A B C D E F G\n\nvoid showDigit(int digit) {\n  // TODO: Set all seven segments to display digit (0 to 9).\n}\n\nvoid setup() {\n  // TODO: Configure the segment pins.\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  // TODO: Count from 0 to 9, displaying each digit for one second.\n}\n"
      }
